.TH WERKMEISTER-HOOKS 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-hooks \- Claude Code hook entrypoints: the standards gate, the PR guard and the agent state
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister hooks\fR <action>
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
The Claude Code hook entry points: \fBgate\fR (PreToolUse, per edit), \fBpr\-guard\fR (blocks \fBgh pr create\fR inside a workspace) and \fBagent\-state\fR (records the session's state on every tool call). The hooks a workspace installs call them; the \fBwerkmeister\fR wrapper runs the same modules directly on a fast path. Run them by hand only to debug a hook.
.SH EXAMPLES
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
werkmeister hooks gate
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
